      "title": "The short answer",
      "items": [
        "Only the last two steps exist: the channel and the Desk",
        "Everything before them is planned: surface A signs who asked into each request, the tunnel brings it to the host, and the VP adapter, checking that signature against the gateway's pinned key, is the one place a caller's identity may come from"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not shown here",
      "items": [
